title: Ad-hoc HTTP Server for Data Staging
id: 562ec7bd-f6a7-4d9b-8e83-7afc213a41f4
status: experimental
description: Detects launching an ad-hoc web server (python -m http.server, php -S, busybox httpd) on a host, frequently used by attackers to stage files for download or serve payloads to other hosts.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1567/
logsource:
  product: linux
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'http.server'
      - 'SimpleHTTPServer'
      - 'php -S'
      - 'busybox httpd'
      - 'ruby -run -e httpd'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - User
  - Image
falsepositives:
  - Developers testing locally
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.exfiltration
  - attack.t1567
